2	// One block per (query tile, batch*head); BLOCK_M=128 query rows, 8 warps
3	// (16 rows each); K/V tiles of BLOCK_N=32 staged via cp.async double buffer.
4	// Supports MHA and GQA (kv_heads <= heads), causal and non-causal, any S.
